{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49418","headline":"小重山 二 · 和凝","name":"小重山 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"正是神京烂熳时，羣仙初折得，郄诜枝。\n乌犀白紵最相宜，精神出，御陌袖鞭垂。\n柳色展愁眉，管弦分响亮，探花期。\n光阴占断曲江池，新牓上，名姓彻丹墀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"和凝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49418.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49418","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}